\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(A\\in\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee8677f552ac477b\" href=\"?note=ee8677f552ac477b\" title=\"20-df-ck\">20-df-ck</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1425fc4773bfa69c\" href=\"?note=1425fc4773bfa69c\" title=\"20-df-computable-wellorder\">20-df-computable-wellorder</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0abc357ef7715d00\" href=\"?note=0abc357ef7715d00\" title=\"20-df-anal\">20-df-anal</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 是可计算良序型的上确界，见 ck；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CK}\">\\(\\mathrm{CK}\\)</span> 是名称下标。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spector\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\sup\\{|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}:e\\in A\\}&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spector\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\sup\\{|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}:e\\in A\\}&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A 是良序的自然数索引集合，不能直接把一个 Σ11 数集的成员当作二元关系取序型。严格共同界强于每个序型分别小于 CK；后者不能作为前者的证明。书外有效有界性证明未在本轮重建。</p>\n<p>来源：既有 Spector 陈述的类型修复；原文待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"ee8677f552ac477b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ck]